# Both faces of Dire Flail. The Flail equipped (Equip {1}) gives Ornithopter +2/+0; crafting it while it is attached exiles
# it, so the Ornithopter loses the bonus and Dire Blunderbuss returns unattached (a new object, CR 400.7). Equipped with
# the Blunderbuss, the Ornithopter is 3/2 and has "Whenever this creature attacks, you may sacrifice an artifact other
# than Dire Blunderbuss. When you do, this creature deals damage equal to its power to target creature." It attacks:
# the Blunderbuss itself is not among the artifacts it may sacrifice (the refusal) and a Mox Ruby is (the positive
# control); the reflexive ability (CR 603.12) then targets Bot2's Ornithopter as it goes on the stack and deals it 3,
# the attacker's power.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Dire Flail
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mountain
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

